e":["xuhuwang-q-a3bd9583b1df1ab5c64d"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-a3bd9583b1df1ab5c64d"]},"ordering_evidence":"xuhuwang-q-a3bd9583b1df1ab5c64d","related_events":[{"event":"shaodi-e-o040a","type":"related","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-a3bd9583b1df1ab5c64d","shaodi-e-o040a-q"]}],"order":5302}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0017","name":"高柔","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0022","name":"徐邈","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-e8f4da380583cef11970","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-24a29ebf8cf0df3164ca","layer":"original","quote":"后徙司徒。太傅司马宣王奏免曹爽，皇太后诏召柔〖1〗，假节，行大将军事，据爽营。太傅谓柔曰：“君为周勃矣〖2〗。”爽诛，进封万岁乡侯。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":84},{"id":"shaodi-e-o040a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-eee70bd9a5c82e0ea03f","layer":"original","quote":"四月，以司空高柔为司徒；光禄大夫徐邈为司空〖26〗，固辞不受。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-60775abea476f875fc24","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-60775abea476f875fc24","layer":"modern","quote":"〖21〗九年：正始九年（公元 248）。参照下文，在“二月”之后应当有记日的干支。此处史文疑有脱落。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8324fe8afd82c8552b28","start":0,"end":50},{"id":"shaodi-q-o039","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-e10813740402816008fd","layer":"original","quote":"九年春二月〖21〗，卫将军、中书令孙资；癸巳〖22〗，骠骑将军、中书监刘放；三月甲午〖23〗，司徒卫臻：各逊位，以侯就第〖24〗，位特进〖25〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-6f848e6d495f38a35bb4","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-53b56755c6321df5b03e","layer":"original","quote":"数岁即拜司空，邈叹曰：“三公论道之官〖29〗，无其人则缺。岂可以老病忝之哉！”遂固辞不受。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":36,"end":81},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-a3bd9583b1df1ab5c64d","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-63e8a976118c605183ac","layer":"original","quote":"卢钦著书，称邈曰：“徐公志高行洁，才博气猛。其施之也，高而不狷〖7〗，洁而不介〖8〗；博而守约，猛而能宽。圣人以靖为难，而徐公之所易也。”","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-add1b29ff84a6a99769f","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-772676769e8bfe67cf55","layer":"original","quote":"或问钦：“徐公当武帝之时〖9〗，人以为通〖10〗；自在凉州及还京师，人以为介。何也？”钦答曰：“往者毛孝先、崔季珪等用事〖11〗，贵清素之士，于时皆变易车服以求名高〖12〗，而徐公不改其常，故人以为通；比来天下奢靡〖13〗，转相仿效，而徐公雅尚自若，不与俗同。故前日之通，乃今日之介也；是世人之无常，而徐公之有常也。”","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":159}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
